          "entry_id": 2847,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3349228,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2856,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.28615654,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Questions and complaints about privacy\n\nOur privacy officer answers questions about how your information is used and handles privacy complaints. Ask the front desk for the privacy officer's contact details.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2854,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.27948052,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank details, Social Security number or insurance member ID by text message or email. If you receive a message like that which claims to come from us, do not reply to it, and call the front desk on (212) 555-0142.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2842,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24775425,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2854,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.24698135,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Changing your phone number or email address\n\nTell the front desk at check-in, or update the contact section of Form PR-1 at the self-check-in kiosk. Reminders are sent to the phone number we hold when the reminder goes out.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2841,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2368082,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2854,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.22248897,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2844,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.21620753,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insu",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2855,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.20392251,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2843,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.20175222,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2849,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.20142078,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2848,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.19695306,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2846,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.19489208,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express),",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2858,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.19409214,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this list, the front desk can tell you what it is.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2855,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.18879128,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2856,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.18871301,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## How long we keep records\n\nWe keep adult medical records for 10 years after your last visit.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2856,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.18803145,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who han",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2854,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.18410763,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2849,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.18361107,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Cigna\n\nWe are in-network with Cigna Open Access Plus (OAP) and Cigna PPO plans. Cigna LocalPlus plans are in-network only for members who live in our county; the network area",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2857,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.17937472,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Long-term conditions\n\nIf you live with a long-term condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, asthma or COPD, your GP will agree a regular review schedule w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2856,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.17837796,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2853,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.17572516,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## Checking in on time\n\nCheck in at the front desk or at the self-check-in kiosk as soon as you arrive. Your arrival is recorded when you check in, not when you enter the building.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2840,
